msgstr "Někotre z nowych wěcow w tutym wudaću KMail su:"

#: ./about/introduction_kmail.html:34
msgid ""
"Please take a moment to fill in the KMail configuration panel at Settings-"
">Configure KMail. You need to create at least a default identity and "
"incoming as well as outgoing mail account."
msgstr ""
"Prošu bjerće sej wokomik za wupjelnjenje KMail-konfiguraciji w Nastajenja-"
">Kmail připrawić. Dyrbiće znajmjeńša standardnu identitu wutworić a mejlowe "
"konto za dóstawanje a pósłanje mejlkow."

#: ./about/introduction_kmail.html:38
